[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 61 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 63 [34m[0m
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 62 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 64 [34m[0m4. **Configure git to use delta:**<br>
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 63 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 65 [34m[0m    (Note that delta defaults to a light theme, so if you're using a dark terminal background, you'll want to use `--dark` or `--theme=<theme-name>`.)

[34m────────────[0m[34m┐[0m
[34m•[0m  OPTIONS: [34m│[0m
[34m────────────[0m[34m┘[0m
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 65 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 67 [34m[0m    Edit your `~/.gitconfig`:
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 66 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 68 [34m[0m    ```
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 67 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 69 [34m[0m    [core]
[34m[38;5;88m 68 [34m[38;5;28m    [34m[31m        pager = delta[1;7m | less -R[0m
[34m[38;5;88m    [34m[38;5;28m 70 [34m[32m        pager = delta[0m
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 69 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 71 [34m[0m    ```
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 70 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 72 [34m[0m    Alternatively, run this command:
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 71 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 73 [34m[0m    ```
[34m[38;5;88m 72 [34m[38;5;28m    [34m[31m    git config --global core.pager 'delta[1;7m | less -R[0m[31m'[0m
[34m[38;5;88m    [34m[38;5;28m 74 [34m[32m    git config --global core.pager 'delta'[0m
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 73 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 75 [34m[0m    ```
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 74 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 76 [34m[0m
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 75 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 77 [34m[0m    You can pass arguments to delta in your `.gitconfig`. An example is
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 76 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 78 [34m[0m    ```
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 77 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 79 [34m[0m    [core]
[34m[38;5;88m 78 [34m[38;5;28m    [34m[31m        pager = delta --width=100 --plus-color="#012800" --minus-color="#340001" --theme="base16-ocean.dark"[1;7m | less -R[0m
[34m[38;5;88m    [34m[38;5;28m 80 [34m[32m        pager = delta --width=100 --plus-color="#012800" --minus-color="#340001" --theme="base16-ocean.dark"[0m
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 79 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 81 [34m[0m    ```
[34m[38;2;68;68;68m 80 [34m[38;2;68;68;68m 82 [34m[0m    Please include the `=` characters; I'm not sure why yet, but they're necessary when writing a delta command line in `.gitconfig`!
